description.para:
When executing this application, two jack ports will be created;
                one input and one output. Other applications can be hooked up to
                these ports to access audio coming from, or being send to the channel.

The above example, of course, does not require the use of this function, as it could have been invoked
                using the Gosub application directly. However, if constrained to just using variables or functions,
                EVAL_SUB would be required.
